The nine-product assortment was designed to extend the campaign’s relevance beyond the kitchen.
For customers interested in cooking, the collection includes:
a four-piece knife set with a paring knife, chef’s knife, bread knife and sharpener;
a three-piece set featuring a cleaver, slicing knife and tomato knife;
a six-piece steak knife set;
a two-piece carving set.
The knives combine stainless-steel blades with practical features such as long-lasting sharpness, easy maintenance and secure handling.
The collection also includes practical products for travel, work and everyday use :
a 4-in-1 carabiner;
a 9-in-1 multifunctional knife;
13-in-1 multifunctional pliers;
a high-performance flashlight;
a 750 ml hot-and-cold thermal flask.
The multifunctional products were selected for their versatility, durability and everyday usefulness.
